        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2531] When the EVCC receives the parameter ECDHCurve set to \"SECP521\", it shall use the 1056 least significant bits of the DHPublicKey as the public key in calculation of the session key as defined by [V2G20-2535].",
